					new AbortController().signal,
					null,
					{ cwd: env.tmpDir },
				);
				// The ast-grep child runs from a pi-lens-owned neutral cwd when its npx
				// fallback wins (#4193), so every target must be absolute before dispatch.
				expect(search).toHaveBeenCalledWith(
					"foo($X)",
					"typescript",
